    "survey": "Mission Dolores Neighborhood Historic Context Statement, adopted 2022",
    "source": "mission-dolores-context-statement",
    "note": "Identified as the Holy Family Day Home. The statement's list of properties listed in or formally determined eligible for the National Register and the California Register gives the Holy Family Day Home as 229 Dolores Street, a separate parcel on the same block; its bibliography cites a 1991 archival study of the Holy Family Day Home project parcel at 299 Dolores Street."
